  "abstract": "<jats:p>\n                    (Abstracted from\n                    <jats:italic toggle=\"yes\">Am J Obstet Gynecol</jats:italic>\n                    2024;231:330.e1–330.e14)\n                  </jats:p>\n                  <jats:p>\n                    <jats:italic toggle=\"yes\">BRCA1</jats:italic>\n                    gene mutations significantly increase the risk of breast, ovarian, and pancreatic cancer. Early interventions, such as screening, chemoprevention, and risk-reducing surgeries—including bilateral mastectomy (RRBM) and salpingo-oophorectomy (rrBSO)—have been shown to lower cancer risk and mortality.\n                  </jats:p>",
